                        "tree_id":  "5ee4c0a4dacd899596dd6ad3bef8c4cdb0b55951",
                        "message":  "fix: triet de loai bo bieu thuc param IS NULL trong PositionAssignmentRepository de tranh loi PostgreSQL type inference\n\n- Nguyen nhan van bi loi tren FE:\n  O commit truoc, mac du da bo \u0027:excludeId IS NULL\u0027, nhung trong cau query\n  van con bieu thuc \u0027:from IS NULL\u0027 va \u0027:to IS NULL\u0027.\n  Hibernate khi dich ra SQL da tao ra tham so positional rieng biet\n  (vi du: ? IS NULL OR pa.effective_to \u003e= ?), khien PostgreSQL JDBC van tiep\n  tuc qu─âng ngoai le \u0027PSQLException: could not determine data type of parameter\u0027\n  cho tham so dung trong \u0027? IS NULL\u0027.\n\n- Giai phap triet de:\n  1. Tach thanh 4 query ro rang:\n     - existsOverlappingWithTo: tao moi co thoi han (to != null)\n     - existsOverlappingOpenEnded: tao moi vo thoi han (to == null)\n     - existsOverlappingWithToExcluding: cap nhat co thoi han (to != null, excludeId != null)\n     - existsOverlappingOpenEndedExcluding: cap nhat vo thoi han (to == null, excludeId != null)\n  2. Toan bo tham so (:userId, :from, :to, :excludeId) deu duoc so sanh truc\n     tiep voi cac cot entity tuong ung, khong con bat ky menh de \u0027? IS NULL\u0027\n     nao danh cho tham so.\n  3. Cap nhat integration test PositionAssignmentRepositoryTest kiem tra du 4 case.",
                        "timestamp":  "2026-10-22T18:21:17Z",
                        "author":  {
                                       "name":  "NamNH05",
                                       "email":  "nhnam18105@gmail.com"
                                   },
